visit.\\n\\n## Returning a badge\\n\\nVisitors return badges at the front desk on their way out. Wipe the badge with the cleaning cloth kept in the top drawer and put it back in the return tray. Badges in the return tray are re-used the same day.\\n\\n## If a badge is not returned\\n\\nMark the visitor's line on the expected-visitor list with an N. At the end of the day, send the list of unreturned badges to the security office. Badges that have been missing for 7 days are deactivated.\\n\\n## Contractors\\n\\nContractors on a job lasting more than one day are issued a week badge instead of a day badge. A week badge is valid for 7 days from the date printed on it. Contractors sign the contractor register in addition to the visitor list.\\n\\n## Lost badges found later\\n\\nA badge handed in after it was reported missing goes to the security office rather than back into the return tray. The security office decides whether to reactivate it.\",\n  \"decisions\": [\n    {\n      \"slot\": \"title\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"# Badge Access - Front Desk Procedure\",\n          \"document\": \"source_a.md\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"# Visitor Badge Handling\",\n          \"document\": \"source_b.md\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"chosen\": \"# Badge Access - Front Desk Procedure\",\n      \"reason\": \"Base title specifies the front desk procedure context.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"dispositions\": [\n    {\n      \"segment\": \"b1\",\n      \"disposition\": \"superseded\",\n      \"replacement\": \"# Badge Access - Front Desk Procedure\",\n      \"reason\": \"Base title chosen; more specific about context.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"segment\": \"b2\",\n      \"disposition\": \"duplicate\",\n      \"replacement\": \"## Issuing a visitor badge\",\n      \"reason\": \"Same as a2.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"segment\": \"b3\",\n      \"disposition\": \"duplicate\",\n      \"replacement\": \"Ask the visitor for photo identification and check the name against the day's expected-visitor list.\",\n      \"reason\": \"Same as a3.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"segment\": \"b4\",\n      \"disposition\": \"duplicate\",\n      \"replacement\": \"Print a badge from the front desk terminal.\",\n      \"reason\": \"Same as a4.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"segment\": \"b5\",\n      \"disposition\": \"duplicate\",\n      \"replacement\": \"Write the host's name on the badge in the space provided.\",\n      \"reason\": \"Same as a5.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"segment\": \"b6\",\n      \"disposition\": \"duplicate\",\n      \"replacement\": \"Hand the badge over and ask the visitor to wear it above the waist and in view for the whole visit.\",\n      \"reason\": \"Same as a6.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"segment\": \"b7\",\n      \"disposition\": \"duplicate\",\n      \"replacement\": \"## Returning a badge\",\n      \"reason\": \"Same as a7.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"segment\": \"b8\",\n      \"disposition\": \"duplicate\",\n      \"replacement\": \"Visitors return badges at the front desk on their way out.\",\n      \"reason\": \"Same as a8.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"segment\": \"b9\",\n      \"disposition\": \"duplicate\",\n      \"replacement\": \"Wipe the badge with the cleaning cloth kept in the top drawer and put it back in the return tray.\",\n      \"reason\": \"Same as a9.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"segment\": \"b10\",\n      \"disposition\": \"duplicate\",\n      \"replacement\": \"Badges in the return tray are re-used the same day.\",\n      \"reason\": \"Same as a10.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"segment\": \"b11\",\n      \"disposition\": \"duplicate\",\n      \"replacement\": \"## If a badge is not returned\",\n      \"reason\": \"Same as a11.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"segment\": \"b12\",\n      \"disposition\": \"duplicate\",\n      \"replacement\": \"Mark the visitor's line on the expected-visitor list with an N. At the end of the day, send the list of unreturned badges to the security office.\",\n      \"reason\": \"Same as a12.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"segment\": \"b13\",\n      \"disposition\": \"duplicate\",\n      \"replacement\": \"Badges that have been missing for 7 days are deactivated.\",\n      \"reason\": \"Same as a13.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"mismatch\": \"\"\n}\n```","ttft_ms":94084,"type":"result","duration_ms":99215,"uuid":"9ffb4f45-5505-40c1-b2ef-8b02cf4bd0c8","ttft_stream_ms":1617,"time_to_request_ms":61,"first_content_frame_ms":1618,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
